     <tr>\n                        <td>Compressor Type</td>\n                        <td>Optical Fiber Terminal Joint Box(2-way)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Ports &amp; Slots</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Ports</td>\n                        <td>2-way fiber optic ports for easy cable routing</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Protection</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Protection</td>\n                        <td>IP65-rated for dust and water resistance</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Other Features</td>\n                        <td>Indoor Type<br>\nWall-Mount</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Color</td>\n                        <td>Black</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Material</td>\n                        <td>Plastic</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                    </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2 style=\"text-align: justify; \"><b>2 Port TV Home TJ Fiber Joint Box</b></h2><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">The TJ Box / <a href=\"/fiber-optic-accessories/fiber-joint-enclosure-tj-box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fiber Joint Box </a>2 Port is a durable and reliable fiber optic terminal joint box designed for efficient fiber cable management. This 2-port fiber joint box is ideal for protecting and organizing fiber connections, ensuring secure and stable data transmission. It is commonly used in telecommunications, broadband networks, and fiber-to-the-home (FTTH) applications. Built with high-quality plastic material, the TJ Box is designed to withstand environmental challenges while ensuring long-term durability. It features an IP65-rated protection, making it dustproof and water-resistant, ensuring uninterrupted fiber connectivity even in challenging conditions. This level of protection is essential for preventing dust, moisture, and other contaminants from affecting fiber performance. The 2-way fiber optic ports allow for easy cable routing, reducing clutter and simplifying fiber management. Its compact and lightweight design makes it an excellent choice for indoor installations, particularly in data centers, server rooms, and residential fiber setups. The wall-mount feature enhances its versatility, allowing for secure and space-saving installation. The TJ Box / Fiber Joint Box 2 Port is designed to support fiber optic splicing, termination, and distribution, ensuring minimal signal loss and optimal fiber performance. Whether used in commercial, industrial, or home networking environments, this fiber joint box provides a secure and organized solution for fiber cable connections. With its rugged construction, easy installation, and superior protection, the TJ Box 2 Port is an essential component for anyone looking to maintain high-quality fiber optic connections. It is an affordable and effective solution for managing fiber cables, ensuring seamless and efficient data transmission across various network applications.</p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify; \"><b>Features of TJ Box / Fiber Joint Box 2 Port</b></h3><ul><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">2-Port Fiber Joint Box – Designed for efficient fiber cable splicing and management, ensuring stable and secure connections.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">IP65 Protection – Dustproof and water-resistant, providing reliable performance in challenging indoor environments.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Durable Plastic Construction – Made from high-quality plastic, offering long-lasting durability and resistance to environmental factors.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Easy Cable Routing – Features 2-way fiber optic ports, allowing smooth and hassle-free cable organization.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Indoor Application – Specifically designed for indoor fiber optic installations, making it ideal for data centers, home networks, and telecom systems.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Wall-Mount Design – Space-saving wall-mounted installation, ensuring secure and organized fiber management.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Compact and Lightweight – A sleek black design that is easy to install and blends well with various setups.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Reliable Fiber Protection – Keeps fiber connections safe from dust, moisture, and physical damage, ensuring optimal network performance.</li></ul>\n              </d